{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01B6vgReEvoj1ukmXkTGdrxb","type":"tool_result","content":"// Byte-level text helpers for git output (spec 04, 2.15 and 3.4).\nexport { compareBytes } from '../gocompat/strings.js'\n\n// Splits on \"\\n\" and drops empty strings (no trimming).\nexport function nonEmptyLines (s:string):string[] {\n    return s.split('\\n').filter(line => line !== '')\n}\n\n// Splits raw git output on NUL, dropping exactly one trailing empty\n// element. Empty input yields no elements.\nexport function splitNul (buf:Buffer):Buffer[] {\n    const out:Buffer[] = []\n    let start = 0\n    while (start < buf.length) {\n        const nul = buf.indexOf(0, start)\n        if (nul === -1) {\n            out.push(buf.subarray(start))\n            break\n        }\n        out.push(buf.subarray(start, nul))\n        start = nul + 1\n    }\n    return out\n}\n\nexport interface DecodedPaths {\n    paths:string[];\n    // Names that are not valid UTF-8 and were dropped.\n    skipped:number;\n}\n\nconst fatal = new TextDecoder('utf-8', { fatal:true })\n\n// One raw name as a string, or null when it is not valid UTF-8.\nexport function decodeName (raw:Buffer):string|null {\n    try {\n        return fatal.decode(raw)\n    } catch {\n        return null\n    }\n}\n\n// Decodes NUL-separated path names. A name that is not valid UTF-8\n// cannot round-trip through a JS string, so it is skipped and counted.\nexport function decodePaths (buf:Buffer):DecodedPaths {\n    const paths:string[] = []\n    let skipped = 0\n    for (const raw of splitNul(buf)) {\n        const name = decodeName(raw)\n        if (name === null) skipped++\n        else paths.push(name)\n    }\n    return { paths, skipped }\n}\n145:145:11. A run ID must be a plain name: `.`, `..`, and path separators are\n147:147:12. `runs checkout` clears an inherited `GIT_INDEX_FILE`, and resolves a\n155:155:    `core.quotePath=false`; non-ASCII paths are no longer skipped or\n171:171:24. File names that are not valid UTF-8 are skipped with a warning.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Tw6eUvmTfMfsVNapeDwjUZ","agent_id":"acf0b2540a7701a5f","session_id":"88028451-5f39-411f-b6c1-a60f530aedf7","uuid":"3265f93c-6bd6-4d79-9553-2330564dde8b","timestamp":"2026-11-24T04:04:07.448Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01B6vgReEvoj1ukmXkTGdrxb","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"ed3d-basic-agents:opus-general-purpose","task_description":"Review snapshot/runs/survey"}
